          "This path is closed for some adult convictions, including kidnapping, false imprisonment, sexual battery, and getting a child under 16 into a sex act if the child was under 12 or force or coercion was used. They also include adult molestation of a child under 12, and adult molestation of a child 12 to 15 with force or coercion and bare genitals. Lewd battery on an elderly or disabled adult, and attempts or conspiracies to commit any of these, are closed too.",
