          "A purpose the law names. That means you meant to help the crime go on, or you knew the deal was set up, even in part, to hide the money's nature, location, source, owner, or control. Dodging a reporting rule or a money transmitter registration rule also counts. Moving cash or funds, and dealing in money an officer says is dirty, are covered too.",
