          "Early on, the complaint and the investigation file are kept private. That lasts until the agency takes final action, until the case is sent for prosecution, or until 10 days after the complaint is found to have no merit. Some files stay private for good. That is why you should call a lawyer at the audit letter, not at the arrest.",
