          "In a money case, those caps can go higher. The fine can equal double what you gained or double what the victim lost. Court costs add $50 on a felony and $20 on other charges.",
          "Unless a record is sealed or expunged, a Florida arrest is public. An ordinary background check can turn up a fraud arrest. The people running those checks often decide who gets trusted with money, accounts, and customers.",
