          "For circuit criminal matters, the county Clerk points to Room 101 of the Edgecomb Courthouse at 800 E. Twiggs Street. In Plant City, criminal court services sit in Room 1071 of the courthouse at 301 North Michigan Avenue.",
          "In a federal case, the United States Attorney's Office for the Middle District of Florida brings the charge. A Tampa case is heard at the Sam M. Gibbons United States Courthouse, 801 North Florida Avenue.",
